 result←object style arg;bits;props;isize;psize;defn;pxsize;yr;xr
⍝   0=Image unscaled and centered (but truncated to imagesize first)
⍝   2=Image is tiled to fill
⍝   4=Image is scaled to fit
⍝   16=Vertical scroll bar
⍝   64=Horizontal scroll bar

 :If 0=≢arg
     result←object ⎕VGET⊂'_style' 0
 :Else
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: style'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt arg←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI ATTRIBUTE ERROR: Invalid "style" attribute specified'##.##.Error∨/∊arg<0
     arg←+/bits←##._supp.SetBitVals arg
     '∆WI ATTRIBUTE ERROR: Invalid "style" attribute specified'##.##.Error∧/2 4∊bits
     '∆WI ATTRIBUTE ERROR: Invalid "style" attribute specified'##.##.Error(arg≥64×2)∨×≢bits~0 2 4 16 64
     object._style←arg
     props←⍬
     props,←0/⊂'VScroll'(-16∊bits) ⍝? Can only be set during creation
     props,←0/⊂'HScroll'(-64∊bits) ⍝? Can only be set during creation
     ⍝object ##.##.∆WS props ⍝? Uncomment when we can change scroll bars
     (psize isize defn)←object ⎕VGET('_size'⍬)('_imagesize'⍬)('_bitmap' '')
     ⍝ Note: ANY assignment of style will reset the image to empty, except for any restored bitmap value
     {}object bitmap,⊂defn ⍝ Reconstitute the starting bitmap information they previously defined
     result←##.NoRes
 :EndIf
